[2026-06-01T18:02:00.000Z] Tomas: Suri is checking the river trail.
[2026-06-01T18:03:00.000Z] Roan: Birch Watch has enough lamp oil.
[2026-06-01T18:04:00.000Z] Suri: We will report again after sunset.
[END UNTRUSTED CHAT MESSAGE DATA]

